WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:12.041
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Okinawa is an island about four hundred miles south of Japan.

2
00:00:14.539 --> 00:00:23.543
It’s a beautiful island, with wonderful beaches and clear blue water.

3
00:00:28.174 --> 00:00:37.264
It also has more centenarians – people who are a hundred years old or more – than anywhere else in the world.

4
00:00:37.953 --> 00:00:42.477
What’s more, they seem to age more slowly than other people.

5
00:00:43.489 --> 00:00:51.653
According to scientists, people there who are actually seventy often have the bodies of fifty-year olds.

6
00:00:53.526 --> 00:00:57.791
Many of them are very healthy all through their lives.

7
00:00:58.114 --> 00:00:59.730
What’s their secret?

8
00:01:00.915 --> 00:01:04.770
Most people think it’s because of their healthy lifestyle.

9
00:01:07.054 --> 00:01:14.011
They don’t have big meals – they have a cultural habit called hara hachi bu,

10
00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:18.663
which means they always stop eating before they’re full.

11
00:01:20.365 --> 00:01:24.544
They usually just have fish and vegetables,

12
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:30.467
especially sweet potatoes, and they eat a lot of seaweed,

13
00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:33.591
which is one of the healthiest foods that there is.

14
00:01:34.603 --> 00:01:38.394
But diet isn’t the only reason why they live so long.

15
00:01:41.517 --> 00:01:50.155
The Okinawans are very active, and they often work in their gardens until they’re eighty or more.

16
00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:58.275
Many of them also do t’ai chi or martial arts, every day.

17
00:02:01.894 --> 00:02:04.113
They have a good social life.

18
00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:11.888
They visit friends or family, and a lot of them belong to community centres.

19
00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:21.387
Some play the traditional Okinawan guitar, an instrument similar to a banjo.

20
00:02:27.311 --> 00:02:33.084
The old people of Okinawa are very positive and happy with their lives.

21
00:02:33.816 --> 00:02:37.176
They aren’t stressed, because they’re never in a hurry.

22
00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:47.386
Their spiritual lives are important to them, especially the women, and many of them meditate every day.

23
00:02:48.377 --> 00:02:53.697
In Okinawa, people say you’re a child until you are fifty-five.

24
00:02:53.891 --> 00:02:55.733
And when you reach ninety-seven,

25
00:02:55.873 --> 00:03:04.176
your local town holds a special ceremony called kajimaya to celebrate the fact that now it’s time to be young again,

26
00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:09.744
to be free of all responsibilities and to simply enjoy life.